<header>
	<h1>API Keys</h1>

	<p>
	 These API keys are used to allow third-party software to access your Deskpro data.
	 You can create, regenerate or delete API keys here.
	</p>
</header>


<article>
	<section>
	
		<p>The Deskpro REST API lets external code interact with your helpdesk, using the standard HTTP web protocols.</p>
		<p>An API key lets somebody change data within your helpdesk. Only give out API keys to services you trust - do not make them public.
		</p>
		<p>If you are concerned that an API key has become public, regenerate the API key and supply the updated key to the relevant service.
		</p>
	</section>
